        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Amplification &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Gilded Core</p><p><em>Everything already there gets brighter and slower and more certain of itself.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>At daily preparations, choose one other bound Substrate. It counts as <strong>one Depth higher</strong> for its numeric effects. This can never exceed your level's Depth cap.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>The chosen Substrate also gains the <strong>rider</strong> of that higher Depth, not only the numbers.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Choose <strong>two</strong> Substrates instead of one.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per day, as a free action, one chosen Substrate manifests at <strong>Depth 4</strong> for 1 minute regardless of its real Depth. <em>Apotheosis.</em></td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
        },
